WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.240
[Characters, behaviors, places, organizations, professions, or events shown in the series

3
00:01.260 --> 00:02.500
are entirely fictional, solely for the purpose of entertainment,

4
00:02.520 --> 00:03.760
with no intention to instruct or promote any kind of behavior;

5
00:03.780 --> 00:05.000
viewer discretion is advised]

6
00:08.280 --> 00:09.600
Who are you?

7
00:14.200 --> 00:16.560
All the merits I have accumulated,

8
00:16.840 --> 00:19.620
I dedicate to Master Bulan.

9
00:19.640 --> 00:23.360
May you protect her and keep her safe

10
00:24.200 --> 00:26.180
for as long as I shall breathe.

11
00:28.480 --> 00:29.320
Here you go,

12
00:29.640 --> 00:31.640
the straw and soil Lieutenant Peem walked on.

13
00:32.680 --> 00:34.600
What are you gonna do with these things?

14
00:38.480 --> 00:40.580
I already threw away the nail clippings and strands of hair,

15
00:40.600 --> 00:42.880
just like you asked, my beloved.

16
00:47.160 --> 00:48.200
Anyway,

17
00:49.240 --> 00:51.080
why do we have to do all this?

18
00:51.720 --> 00:53.960
Can't we just leave it?

19
00:54.760 --> 00:56.140
Strands of hair and nail clippings

20
00:56.160 --> 00:58.280
ought to grow from your body.

21
00:58.560 --> 01:00.160
They are one's delegation.

22
01:00.540 --> 01:02.440
Thus, were they to be shed,

23
01:02.680 --> 01:04.060
they shall be disposed of with haste,

24
01:04.080 --> 01:06.480
lest some souls use them to maim you with the dark arts.

25
01:08.960 --> 01:10.960
Ever since the day I met you,

26
01:11.540 --> 01:13.900
Krating has been using the dark arts

27
01:14.440 --> 01:16.120
to set vengeful spirits upon you.

28
01:21.200 --> 01:21.840
Huh?

29
01:22.360 --> 01:23.240
On...

30
01:25.560 --> 01:26.360
me?

31
01:27.720 --> 01:29.600
Whatever has been betiding you

32
01:30.160 --> 01:31.840
is no coincidence.

33
01:34.920 --> 01:35.960
I am worried.

34
01:38.480 --> 01:39.200
Alright.

35
01:41.280 --> 01:42.280
Before...

36
01:42.300 --> 01:44.840
I decided to travel here,

37
01:45.260 --> 01:48.780
I also went through hell.

38
01:56.000 --> 01:58.000
Now that I know this...

39
01:59.300 --> 02:03.040
I guess I have to reward you for rescuing me, my beloved.

40
02:18.520 --> 02:20.320
I would have you tread softly.

41
02:21.000 --> 02:22.480
Your foe

42
02:22.500 --> 02:23.920
is full of tricks.

43
02:24.530 --> 02:26.300
Last time, he cast a spell

44
02:26.320 --> 02:28.320
that forced you to use the consecrated bullets.

45
02:29.040 --> 02:30.480
What schemes

46
02:30.580 --> 02:32.680
he shall employ against you next, I know not.

47
02:33.760 --> 02:34.800
Do you understand?

48
02:35.740 --> 02:36.860
Yes.

49
02:37.540 --> 02:39.280
I understand.

50
02:40.120 --> 02:41.500
From now on,

51
02:41.520 --> 02:43.320
I'll be careful,

52
02:43.520 --> 02:44.370
and...

53
02:45.260 --> 02:48.480
I won't make you worried about me like this again.

54
03:15.340 --> 03:16.500
Hello, Sarge?

55
03:23.160 --> 03:24.160
What did you say?

56
03:27.680 --> 03:28.780
Of course, Sarge.

57
03:28.800 --> 03:30.680
I'm on my way to the station.

58
03:31.280 --> 03:32.440
What happened?

59
04:05.720 --> 04:10.120
♫Along with ghostly spirits hounding relentlessly,♫

60
04:10.140 --> 04:14.790
♫May the maras be ravaged and perish completely♫

61
04:14.810 --> 04:19.120
♫Vindictive spirits, tyrannical psyches,♫

62
04:19.140 --> 04:23.440
♫Meant to betray, slaughter, and invade,♫

63
04:23.460 --> 04:27.870
♫Were any souls to brush against my karmic soulmate,♫

64
04:27.890 --> 04:32.390
♫They shall bury the thought of returning to their realm♫

65
04:32.410 --> 04:36.500
♫With incantation and virtue as shield,♫

66
04:36.520 --> 04:40.940
♫At my feet, they shall surrender and kneel,♫

67
04:40.960 --> 04:46.070
♫Chanting, "Sadhu," of their own will♫

68
05:11.280 --> 05:12.860
Faii's been unreachable since last night.

69
05:13.680 --> 05:14.780
Her mother said

70
05:14.800 --> 05:15.800
she couldn't be reached.

71
05:16.200 --> 05:17.200
As for Priew,

72
05:18.120 --> 05:18.920
she said that

73
05:19.480 --> 05:20.840
they went their separate ways after the temple fair ended.

74
05:22.160 --> 05:23.140
And Faii

75
05:23.520 --> 05:24.640
was waiting for her boyfriend to pick her up.

76
05:26.560 --> 05:28.220
Have you two ever...

77
05:28.240 --> 05:29.760
met her boyfriend?

78
05:30.160 --> 05:31.320
Never.

79
05:31.340 --> 05:34.300
I only just found out that she has one.

80
05:34.320 --> 05:35.940
She never told us anything.

81
05:35.960 --> 05:38.120
I just left a comment on the TikTok video

82
05:38.140 --> 05:40.140
she uploaded last night about

83
05:40.160 --> 05:41.640
how obsessed she is with her man!

84
05:41.840 --> 05:42.800
But...

85
05:42.920 --> 05:45.420
after I found out that she had disappeared and wouldn't return,

86
05:45.440 --> 05:47.720
I rushed to show Dad this video.

87
05:57.020 --> 05:59.020
I've coordinated with Mae Sot Police Station.

88
05:59.780 --> 06:01.680
I was informed that, apart from Faii,

89
06:02.280 --> 06:04.820
three other girls were missing that night.

90
06:05.540 --> 06:07.380
I will allow you two

91
06:07.400 --> 06:09.480
to deploy our officers alongside

92
06:10.040 --> 06:12.640
the officers from Mae Sot Police Station.

93
06:13.760 --> 06:14.660
But this time,

94
06:15.140 --> 06:17.360
besides rescuing the victims,

95
06:18.400 --> 06:20.200
you must also capture Krating.

96
06:33.820 --> 06:35.010
This is a joint operation between

97
06:35.020 --> 06:36.900
Mae Sot Police Station and Phop Phra Police Station

98
06:36.920 --> 06:38.480
for this mission. [Mae Sot Provincial Police Station]

99
06:38.800 --> 06:39.840
Everyone, please be seated.

100
06:43.200 --> 06:43.920
Let's get started.

101
06:51.880 --> 06:52.520
Sarge.

102
06:55.020 --> 06:56.200
Not there, Sarge.

103
06:57.880 --> 06:59.820
I saw a yantra tattooed on Krating's body

104
06:59.840 --> 07:01.700
and on a police inspector I'm working with.

105
07:01.720 --> 07:02.960
They are both...

106
07:03.220 --> 07:04.320
tiger figures.

107
07:04.480 --> 07:07.320
Krating's is a decapitated Saming tiger,

108
07:07.440 --> 07:09.140
while the inspector's...

109
07:09.160 --> 07:11.680
is a normal one.

110
07:12.060 --> 07:13.640
How are these two yantras

111
07:13.860 --> 07:15.160
different?

112
07:15.400 --> 07:16.940
The decapitated tiger

113
07:16.960 --> 07:19.480
comes from the Invulnerable Warrior Sanctum.

114
07:19.500 --> 07:20.780
It is a stratagem

115
07:20.800 --> 07:22.620
for overcoming fear,

116
07:22.640 --> 07:23.980
so one may become courageous

117
07:24.000 --> 07:25.400
and fear none.

118
07:28.160 --> 07:29.560
Have you seen the person in this photo?

119
07:30.190 --> 07:31.040
Never.

120
07:42.980 --> 07:44.860
I'm looking for my friend. [Another missing person in Phop Phra?]

121
07:44.880 --> 07:45.940
Her name is Faii. [Definitely kidnapped]

122
07:45.960 --> 07:48.000
- Oh, no, I've never seen this one. - Sarge.

123
07:50.160 --> 07:52.460
My friend went missing.

124
07:52.480 --> 07:54.720
Here, this is what she looks like.

125
08:22.760 --> 08:23.660
If I do this,

126
08:23.680 --> 08:26.320
will I actually come across Krating's clues?

127
08:27.960 --> 08:29.400
Steady your mind.

128
08:29.560 --> 08:31.120
Ponder every detail,

129
08:31.840 --> 08:33.540
whether it seems too difficult

130
08:33.840 --> 08:35.880
or too simple.

131
08:36.300 --> 08:37.960
Nothing happens by coincidence.

132
09:14.580 --> 09:15.640
I now know

133
09:16.940 --> 09:19.800
where I can search for his clues.

134
09:20.400 --> 09:22.200
- Thank you. - Wait, my dearest.

135
09:30.360 --> 09:31.800
This knife is of purity,

136
09:32.320 --> 09:35.120
etched with auspicious glyphs and incantations.

137
09:35.620 --> 09:37.580
I have carved your name upon it

138
09:37.600 --> 09:39.240
so that you may claim it as your own.

139
09:39.720 --> 09:41.440
Were any spirits to brush against it,

140
09:42.040 --> 09:43.700
they shall perish.

141
09:48.640 --> 09:49.680
Last time,

142
09:49.880 --> 09:52.440
you were deceived into using up almost all your bullets.

143
09:52.580 --> 09:54.440
Should this be another trick,

144
09:55.320 --> 09:56.720
use this weapon.

145
10:02.120 --> 10:04.000
Keep it with you at all times,

146
10:05.520 --> 10:07.760
for that shall ease the dread in my heart.

147
10:10.960 --> 10:12.100
Check them carefully.

148
10:12.120 --> 10:13.020
Take inventory, too.

149
10:13.040 --> 10:14.400
- Sure thing, Seua. - The exact quantity, no more, no less.

150
10:18.140 --> 10:18.920
Hey,

151
10:19.480 --> 10:20.680
here comes your sweetheart.

152
10:20.880 --> 10:22.160
My sweetheart?

153
10:24.720 --> 10:26.260
We need to talk, Seua.

154
10:29.720 --> 10:31.340
Tell me Krating's whereabouts.

155
10:33.280 --> 10:34.800
Jeez, Officer.

156
10:35.200 --> 10:37.080
I've already told you everything I know.

157
10:37.360 --> 10:39.600
I haven't been in contact with him for a long time,

158
10:40.520 --> 10:42.340
so how would I know where he's hiding

159
10:42.360 --> 10:43.380
or who he's hiding out with?

160
10:43.400 --> 10:45.680
I don't believe you haven't got a clue, Seua.

161
10:46.720 --> 10:48.480
You were friends with him before, no?

162
10:48.520 --> 10:49.800
Well, I don't know a thing.

163
10:51.040 --> 10:52.300
And even if I did,

164
10:52.320 --> 10:54.480
I wouldn't wanna be caught up in this mess.

165
10:55.220 --> 10:56.340
Last time,

166
10:56.700 --> 10:58.520
some fucking shit possessed me

167
10:58.900 --> 11:00.260
and made me run out in front of a car.

168
11:00.280 --> 11:01.520
I almost died.

169
11:02.480 --> 11:03.480
I'm out.

170
11:04.040 --> 11:06.120
Go search for clues elsewhere, Officer.

171
11:14.280 --> 11:15.840
So where did you get this tattoo?

172
11:17.060 --> 11:19.220
You have the exact same one as Krating.

173
11:20.780 --> 11:23.120
I think you two are closer than you let on.

174
11:32.880 --> 11:33.800
Hello, Sarge.

175
11:34.400 --> 11:36.900
A row of five abandoned three-story shophouses

176
11:36.920 --> 11:37.900
located along a minor road

177
11:37.910 --> 11:40.060
branching off Highway 12,

178
11:40.080 --> 11:42.180
three kilometers from Mae Sot market.

179
11:42.200 --> 11:43.840
I've already sent you the coordinates.

180
11:43.860 --> 11:46.080
Please liaise with Inspector Chon.

181
11:46.600 --> 11:48.400
See you in less than three hours.

182
12:06.640 --> 12:07.720
- Let's go. - Yes.

183
12:08.200 --> 12:08.940
- Sarge. - Go.

184
12:08.960 --> 12:09.640
Yes.

185
12:24.280 --> 12:25.080
Stop!

186
12:27.360 --> 12:28.400
Hands up!

187
12:30.460 --> 12:31.280
On the ground!

188
12:32.120 --> 12:33.280
Do not move!

189
12:34.000 --> 12:34.720
Hands behind your back.

190
12:35.480 --> 12:36.480
- Behind your back! - Hands behind your back.

191
12:39.960 --> 12:40.920
Where are the girls?!

192
12:41.200 --> 12:43.320
I... I don't know.

193
12:43.340 --> 12:44.840
I don't know where the girls are.

194
12:45.200 --> 12:46.020
Where are they?!

195
12:46.040 --> 12:48.400
I really don't know. I just got here from home.

196
12:49.120 --> 12:50.300
Tell us

197
12:50.320 --> 12:51.280
where the girls are.

198
12:51.520 --> 12:52.840
I really don't know.

199
12:53.200 --> 12:54.440
Are those the only words you know?!

200
12:55.080 --> 12:56.080
Where are they?!

201
13:40.680 --> 13:41.440
Faii.

202
13:43.880 --> 13:44.660
Faii...

203
13:46.240 --> 13:47.640
Are you okay, Faii?

204
13:48.560 --> 13:49.280
Faii.

205
13:50.160 --> 13:51.040
Faii!

206
13:51.600 --> 13:52.940
Pull yourself together, Faii.

207
13:57.320 --> 13:59.280
Sarge, I found the...

208
14:44.760 --> 14:45.520
Sarge,

209
14:46.000 --> 14:47.540
come to the main hall immediately.

210
14:47.560 --> 14:49.040
I found Faii and the other girls.

211
14:50.400 --> 14:51.440
I'll leave it to you, Sarge.

212
15:37.240 --> 15:38.240
Where is Krating?

213
16:34.920 --> 16:36.000
Inspector, watch out!

214
16:41.270 --> 16:44.320
How many bullets do you have left, Officer?

215
16:48.280 --> 16:49.560
You scum!

216
16:50.480 --> 16:52.360
This will be the fucking death of you!

217
16:52.960 --> 16:55.800
You're the one who'll fucking die.

218
17:03.120 --> 17:10.240
(Incanting)

219
17:11.000 --> 17:14.960
(Incanting)

220
17:15.640 --> 17:19.640
(Incanting)

221
17:41.360 --> 17:44.560
Mommy, I cannot go in to help Mom.

222
17:45.380 --> 17:48.080
I suppose they no longer relish the thought of living,

223
17:49.320 --> 17:52.080
having so relentlessly laid hands upon my woman.

224
18:00.320 --> 18:14.880
(Incanting)

225
19:46.280 --> 19:46.880
Lieutenant.

226
19:47.120 --> 19:47.780
Lieutenant...

227
19:47.800 --> 19:48.640
No, no.

228
19:49.280 --> 19:50.160
I give up.

229
19:50.640 --> 19:51.640
I give up.

230
19:52.960 --> 19:54.040
You do know

231
19:55.520 --> 19:57.640
how long I've been waiting for this day, right?

232
19:58.060 --> 19:59.440
Fucking capture me, then!

233
20:03.930 --> 20:05.360
I'm already giving up.

234
20:07.840 --> 20:10.360
What about the victims who begged you for their lives?

235
20:11.000 --> 20:12.880
Have you ever given them a fucking chance?!

236
20:13.240 --> 20:15.040
Just capture me, then, you fucking bastard!

237
20:15.880 --> 20:17.440
What else do you fucking want from me?!

238
20:20.680 --> 20:22.160
Only death

239
20:23.000 --> 20:25.120
will serve a piece of fucking scum like you right.

240
20:31.840 --> 20:33.120
From this day forth,

241
20:33.600 --> 20:36.160
let karma take the reins.

242
20:37.280 --> 20:39.160
I merely wish

243
20:39.640 --> 20:41.880
to share my life with my karmic soulmate

244
20:43.400 --> 20:45.720
till fate do us part.

245
20:51.380 --> 20:52.400
Stop it, Lieutenant.

246
20:55.320 --> 20:56.400
If you do this,

247
20:56.560 --> 20:59.000
you will be held liable for excessive force.

248
21:08.320 --> 21:09.520
I don't care.

249
21:13.200 --> 21:16.000
I'm here because I want to capture him.

250
21:17.580 --> 21:20.160
If I don't kill him with my own hands,

251
21:26.520 --> 21:28.800
how would I look my little sister in the eye?

252
21:29.820 --> 21:31.880
But if you get arrested because of this,

253
21:32.240 --> 21:33.900
what would happen to your parents?

254
21:34.900 --> 21:37.400
Are you willing to let everything you've done

255
21:38.160 --> 21:39.560
come to nothing today?

256
21:42.840 --> 21:44.520
Even if you shoot him dead,

257
21:45.680 --> 21:46.880
the victims

258
21:47.480 --> 21:48.440
won't ever come back.

259
21:50.280 --> 21:51.120
I know

260
21:51.920 --> 21:53.100
how you feel.

261
21:54.000 --> 21:55.200
I understand you well.

262
21:57.040 --> 21:59.000
And I do know that right now,

263
21:59.560 --> 22:00.640
your little brother

264
22:01.760 --> 22:03.040
would say the same thing I did.

265
22:04.900 --> 22:06.160
Let the guy live.

266
22:07.360 --> 22:09.000
Let him pay for what he's done.

267
22:11.200 --> 22:12.400
This is not Lieutenant Peem,

268
22:14.100 --> 22:15.380
not their older sister,

269
22:17.120 --> 22:18.120
and not...

270
22:18.880 --> 22:20.160
the lieutenant I know.

271
22:22.520 --> 22:25.040
Leave it to the justice system

272
22:25.240 --> 22:26.840
you've always believed in.

273
22:28.400 --> 22:29.480
I promise you,

274
22:30.360 --> 22:32.000
the law will punish him

275
22:32.640 --> 22:34.640
no less than karmic law will.

276
22:54.720 --> 22:55.660
I,

277
22:57.680 --> 23:00.880
Police Lieutenant Phitcha Ruechakun,

278
23:02.320 --> 23:04.480
hereby report the arrest

279
23:04.680 --> 23:05.880
of a suspect

280
23:07.400 --> 23:10.420
in kidnapping, false imprisonment,

281
23:12.800 --> 23:14.800
and human trafficking cases.

282
23:38.400 --> 23:39.520
You did amazing.

283
23:52.760 --> 23:54.600
Next month would've been Pat's birthday.

284
23:55.560 --> 23:57.480
I was going to buy this for her.

285
23:58.560 --> 24:00.720
Pat came to me in a dream once, Peem.

286
24:01.400 --> 24:02.740
It was as though...

287
24:02.760 --> 24:05.200
she was coming to collect the present I'd promised to buy her.

288
24:21.180 --> 24:22.120
Phu.

289
24:22.140 --> 24:24.360
- Hm? - Like, it's cute and all, but...

290
24:24.700 --> 24:26.400
since you were already buying it for me,

291
24:26.860 --> 24:28.580
didn't it occur to you that it needed snow?

292
24:29.020 --> 24:29.640
What?

293
24:29.960 --> 24:31.300
It needs snow?

294
24:31.320 --> 24:32.600
It does.

295
24:33.040 --> 24:33.480
- Mm, - Come on...

296
24:33.490 --> 24:35.050
I'll buy you a new one next year, then.

297
24:35.070 --> 24:35.920
How does that sound?

298
24:36.680 --> 24:37.880
That means

299
24:38.140 --> 24:39.660
I don't have to go away to study

300
24:39.680 --> 24:41.260
and can just wait here for your present?

301
24:41.280 --> 24:42.860
Don't give me that.

302
24:42.880 --> 24:44.720
Go study. I'll ship it to you then.

303
25:04.980 --> 25:05.960
Hello, Peem.

304
25:06.400 --> 25:07.200
What is it, dear?

305
25:07.600 --> 25:08.860
Is everything okay?

306
25:08.880 --> 25:09.840
I just...

307
25:10.380 --> 25:12.160
wanted to tell you that

308
25:12.460 --> 25:14.800
I arrested Krating.

309
25:15.680 --> 25:16.440
You did, dear?

310
25:17.000 --> 25:18.840
I always knew that

311
25:18.960 --> 25:20.360
you could do it no matter what.

312
25:26.200 --> 25:27.100
And...

313
25:28.780 --> 25:31.240
how is Phu doing, Dad?

314
25:32.320 --> 25:33.760
Still holding steady.

315
25:33.860 --> 25:36.080
There's been no sign that he's waking up.

316
25:36.360 --> 25:38.580
The doctor took him for a CT scan,

317
25:38.600 --> 25:40.720
yet they found no brain abnormalities.

318
25:41.980 --> 25:43.200
But don't worry, Peem.

319
25:43.520 --> 25:45.600
Mom and I have been taking turns to be by his bedside

320
25:46.080 --> 25:48.280
with your grandmother's help.

321
25:49.500 --> 25:51.080
Phu's going to be fine.

322
25:51.480 --> 25:53.220
Uh... Peem. I have to go.

323
25:53.240 --> 25:54.500
I have to tend to a guest.

324
25:54.520 --> 25:55.500
We'll talk later, dear.

325
25:55.520 --> 25:56.160
Yes.

326
26:07.840 --> 26:09.320
Get well soon, Phu.

327
